                           <desc type="AcquisitionNote">The note states that <persName role="owner" ref="https://betamasaheft.eu/PRS15083EstanfasaKr">ʾƎstǝnfāsa Krǝstos</persName> bought the manuscript.</desc>
                           <q xml:lang="gez">ዝመጽሐፍ፡ <choice resp="MK"><sic>ዘእስትንፋስ፡</sic><corr>ዘእስትንፋሰ፡</corr></choice> ክርስቶስ፡ ዘተሰየጦ፡ በወርቁ</q>
